    <briefdescription>
<para>Parsed contents of the manifest.json file inside a PluginBundle. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A PluginBundle is a ZIP archive (conventionally using the .tdb extension) that packages native libraries for multiple platforms together with an optional WASM fallback and an Ed25519 signature of the manifest.</para>
<para>Archive layout: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">plugin.tdb</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">├──<sp/>manifest.json<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>–<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">this</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>structure,<sp/>serialised<sp/>as<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1modules_1ad24edb733d3224421e96cc51f2f1217aa0ecd11c1d7a287401d148a23bbd7a2f8" kindref="member">JSON</ref></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">├──<sp/>plugin.sig<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>–<sp/>Ed25519<sp/>signature<sp/>of<sp/>manifest.json<sp/>(raw<sp/>bytes)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">├──<sp/>linux-x86_64/</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">│<sp/><sp/><sp/>└──<sp/>libplugin.so</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">├──<sp/>windows-x86_64/</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">│<sp/><sp/><sp/>└──<sp/>plugin.dll</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">├──<sp/>macos-arm64/</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">│<sp/><sp/><sp/>└──<sp/>libplugin.dylib</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">└──<sp/>plugin.wasm<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>–<sp/>optional<sp/>portable<sp/>WASM<sp/>fallback</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>The platform token format is &quot;&lt;os&gt;-&lt;arch&gt;&quot; where os ∈ {linux, windows, macos} and arch ∈ {x86_64, arm64, arm, x86}. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
